            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5187] NPE in InterpreterOutput.updateAllResultMessages</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5187</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;With &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5170&quot; title=&quot;Support spark-submit in spark interpreter&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-5170&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-5170&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; we introduced a NPE in our tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
testZeppelinContext(org.apache.zeppelin.spark.IPySparkInterpreterTest)  Time elapsed: 3.633 sec  &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt; ERROR!
java.lang.NullPointerException: &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;
	at org.apache.zeppelin.interpreter.InterpreterOutput.updateAllResultMessages(InterpreterOutput.java:197)
	at org.apache.zeppelin.interpreter.InterpreterOutput.clear(InterpreterOutput.java:190)
	at org.apache.zeppelin.interpreter.InterpreterOutput.clear(InterpreterOutput.java:161)
	at org.apache.zeppelin.spark.Utils.printDeprecateMessage(Utils.java:134)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
